  "releaseNotes": "- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Abstractions 0.5.0-alpha (was 0.4.0-alpha), Compze.DbPool 0.4.0-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.DbPool.MicrosoftSql 0.4.1-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.DbPool.MySql 0.5.1-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.DbPool.PostgreSql 0.4.1-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.DbPool.Sqlite 0.4.0-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.DependencyInjection 0.11.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha), Compze.Hosting 0.5.1-alpha (was 0.4.0-alpha), Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.14.0-internal (was 0.8.0-internal), Compze.Internals.Testing 0.4.0-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.Serialization.Newtonsoft 0.6.2-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha), Compze.Tessaging 0.15.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha), Compze.Tessaging.Transport.AspNetCore 0.5.0-alpha (was 0.4.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.\n- **Requires exact versions of the Compze packages whose internals it uses:** Compze.Sql.MicrosoftSql 0.8.1-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha or newer), Compze.Sql.MySql 0.9.1-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha or newer), Compze.Sql.PostgreSql 0.8.1-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha or newer), Compze.Sql.Sqlite 0.8.1-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha or newer). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here to exactly that version, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
